# Mobile

- Android only — do not add Linux/Web/Desktop Flutter targets unless asked.
- UI must support `listed` items without requiring full file bytes.
- Pin = availability update **and** blob materialization (both steps).
- Put API/sync/local DB in data/services layers; keep widgets thin.
- Use `nix develop .#mobile` (default flake shell is backend-only).
- Follow availability + provenance UX in `docs/sync-protocol.md` (restore/ghost flows).
